// The Overlook (Overlook_2): first sight of the Greyfold from outside (bible 8.2, [F 4.6]).

title: Overlook_Runa
---
Runa: There. The white. We counted it, once. Wider by a wingspan a year.
Runa: Then we stopped counting. Then Mother started again. #plant:4.6
-> It's bigger than it looks from the Edge.
    Runa: Everything is, from inside. That's why we count from out here.
-> Somebody I know walked into it.
    Runa: Then say their name at the bell tonight. We'll hold it for you till you're back.
-> ...
    Runa: I know. Nobody says anything, the first time.
Runa: The road down goes to the bridges. Halden. We don't go. The bridges count tolls, not birds.
<<flag emberdown.overlook.seen 1>>
===
